  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/EnigmaticaModpacks/Assets/blob/master/headers/E-Header.png?raw=true\" width=\"900\" height=\"300\">\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hadkPsTkje\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/195234321836146688?label=Enigmatica Discord&amp;logo=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/follow?screen_name=EnigmaticaPacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/EnigmaticaPacks?color=LimeGreen&amp;label=Twitter @EnigmaticaPacks&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a></p>\n<div>\n<p style=\"font-size:20px;text-align:left\">探索藍色天際的邊際，進入 Enigmatica 對經典玩法的新詮釋：Sky Block。Enigmatic Skies 是一款以進程為基礎的模組包，目標簡單明瞭。然而，要在這寒冷虛空中掙扎求生，有限的資源讓一切絕非易事。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:20px;text-align:left\">在一個沒有怪物的世界裡，唯一真正的威脅就是寒冷本身；隨著你的進展，保暖將是一項持續的挑戰。運用你的煉金術知識，喚醒村民，讓他們透過自定義交易幫助你完成目標。透過煉金術轉化生物——從平凡的到兇猛的——來獲取建造複雜機械和開啟更強大魔法所需的材料。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:20px;text-align:left\">最終，你將駕馭創造之力，讓所有的努力匯聚於最終目標：創造世界種子。</p>\n</div>\n<hr><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W9vF7JG.png\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">使用 <strong>Cold Sweat</strong> 的環境加熱與冷卻機制。保持溫暖，否則就等死吧！</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">餵養你的村民複雜的餐盒，以解鎖他們獨一無二的 <strong>自定義交易</strong>。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">享受 <strong>自動化村民交易</strong>：讓村民吃飽，維持物資供應不斷。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">利用 <strong>Ars Nouveau</strong> 施展強大法術，創造物品與友善的 Alakarkinos 交易。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">透過 <strong>Occultism</strong>、<strong>Malum</strong>、<strong>Genetics</strong> 和 <strong>Ender IO</strong> 進行 <strong>自定義怪物轉化</strong>。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">使用 <strong>Modern Industrialization</strong> 建造複雜的能源基礎設施：從簡單的蒸汽鍋爐到奇幻的核融合能源。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">從 <strong>雲</strong>、<strong>西瓜</strong>，甚至 <strong>回收廢料</strong> 中生產 <strong>水</strong>，以供應你的能源基礎設施和資源生產。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a style=\"font-size:16px\" href=\"https://github.com/EnigmaticaModpacks/EnigmaticSkies/blob/master/MODLIST.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pM07yW9.png\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZPo1G8S.png\"></p>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:center\">我們已經使用 BisectHosting 多年——快速設置、優質支援，而且他們對模組 Minecraft 非常熟悉。伺服器開箱即用，已為此模組包預先配置好，讓你和朋友可以無痛開玩。</p>\n<a style=\"font-size:16px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fenigmatica\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/41121a3d-99ee-463a-9fae-fb1f0e66e79f.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\"><br></a><hr><a style=\"font-size:16px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.enigmatica.net%252fmain%252fhelp-desk%252fguides%252fallocating-memory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OCJJ8B0.png\"></a>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:center\">請分配至少 <span style=\"color:#3d7370;font-size:16px\">4 GB RAM</span> 給 Minecraft。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:center\">完整的設定指南請點擊 <a style=\"font-size:16px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.enigmatica.net%252fmain%252fhelp-desk%252fguides%252fallocating-memory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a> 查看。</p>\n<hr><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/96w5Hdz.png\">\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica2expert\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LzzRcL7.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/Enigmatica6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EoykfJu.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica6expert\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/21295394/156048157-2066ed98-1edc-4eed-a918-5156a9fa97c1.png\"></a></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gist.github.com/assets/21295394/9da93f83-2fc2-4d5d-ad90-6df7e42668a3\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica9expert\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gist.github.com/assets/21295394/51ded114-e962-4ee8-9e86-112c82daf143\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gist.github.com/assets/21295394/da0d7ed3-7106-4df8-8562-015378c839eb\"></a></div>\n</div>",
